# Opacity example. The system secretly chooses state 1 (secret) or 2 with the
# unobservable event 'u'. Only 'a' and 'b' are observable.
# Only the secret state can produce 'b', so observing 'b' reveals the secret.
#   ./build/automata opacity examples/leaky_system.nfa 1 ab
states 4
initial 0
0 u 1
0 u 2
1 a 3
2 a 3
1 b 1
